  "review": {
    "positive": [
      "Sixteen distinct major figures per facing at alpha >=8, independent native facing sources.",
      "Pose composition and source proportions retained very closely; paired major bounding boxes differ only a few pixels.",
      "Glossy red/copper hard plates, black central cybernetic torso/joints, pale groin/abdomen inserts, silver hair and HF blade retained."
    ],
    "limits": [
      "Nominal equal 4x4 cells are not safe extraction rectangles: wide weapons, kicks and KO figures cross nominal quarter divisions, as in source layout.",
      "Requested 36px clear gutters were not achieved while retaining base placements; use measured per-pose rectangles and collision review.",
      "Very low-alpha background speckle exists (alpha 1-7), including some canvas edge pixels; no alpha >=8 touches the canvas edge.",
      "Fidelity is close to the supplied official low-resolution reference, not proof of absolute 1:1. Existing source art stylization remains.",
      "Row2 col4 differs by facing because the native base differs: right low slide, left kneeling side-kick. This generation preserved that source discrepancy."
    ],
    "normalization": "Preserve the existing standing body height, common costume floor anchor and same horizontal anchor as the base; do not normalize each crop independently."
  }
